<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Sept unemployment falls yr/yr to 14.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Belgian Sept unemployment falls yr/yr to 14.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian National Employment Office released the following unemployment data -</p>
<p>    BELGIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	   Sept 96    Aug 96     Sept 95</p>
<p>    Total registered jobless (*) 607,699    620,081    628,632</p>
<p>    Pct of workforce		 14.2	 14.5	 14.8</p>
<p>NOTE - (*) all registered unemployed, whether or not they receive unemployment benefits</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
